OL,3,AFirst giant tuna caught off Yorkshire
OL,4,Asince 1960s
OL,5,
OL,6,FAtlantic bluefin tuna have been caught
OL,7,Foff the coast of Yorkshire for the
OL,8,Ffirst time in an estimated 60 years.
OL,10,FThe giant fish had not been seen in the
OL,11,FNorth Sea since the 1960s due to
OL,12,Foverfishing and the depletion of
OL,13,Fherring shoals, according to
OL,14,Fresearchers from the University of
OL,15,FExeter who have now tagged six off
OL,16,FWhitby.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,307,300,200,140,0,100
