OL,3,AFirst giant tuna caught off Yorkshire
OL,4,Asince 1960s
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn Sunday, the five-person crew on
OL,7,Fboard The Dominator landed a whopping
OL,8,F338kg specimen before repeating the
OL,9,Ffeat a day later with a fish which
OL,10,Fweighed "just a little bit" less,
OL,11,Faccording to crew member Jack Gardner.
OL,13,F"I have never caught anything like it,"
OL,14,Fsaid the 28-year-old from the village
OL,15,Fof Paull, near Hull, calling it the
OL,16,F"best feeling ever".
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
